  "description": "Use your EF-based code without any changes, without raw SQL, without breaking the transactionality and without application crashes due to OutOfMemory errors. Minimal, Effective, multi-target EF Core extension for run short-lived contexts on the same connection and transaction when micro-ORM cannot be used. Short-lived contexts will be used as the SQL formatter, without storing all inserted objects in the application memory due to the short lifetime of the scoped context.",
